---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Python IDE"
  description="IDE 风格的本地 Python 编辑器：打开本地文件夹作为工作目录，多标签语法高亮编辑，py2js 毫秒级转译执行；代码不上传服务器，本地缓存随时可清除"
>
  <h1>🗂️ Python IDE</h1>

  <div class="intro">
    <p><b>IDE 风格的本地 Python 编辑器</b>：打开你电脑上的任意文件夹作为工作目录，左侧浏览文件、中间多标签编辑（语法高亮 / 行号 / Tab 缩进），<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Enter</kbd> 用本站自研的 py2js 毫秒级转译执行。<b>代码不上传任何服务器</b>——文件读写只发生在你的浏览器和本地磁盘之间。</p>
    <p class="muted">🔒 隐私说明：① 「打开文件夹」是浏览器原生的本地授权（File System Access API），页面代码只能访问你选中的那个目录；② 目录连接记忆与未保存内容仅存于浏览器本地缓存（IndexedDB / localStorage），不会同步到云端；③ 左下角「清除本地缓存」可随时一键清空——只清浏览器缓存，<b>不会删除磁盘上的文件</b>。</p>
    <p class="muted">⚙️ 运行引擎为 py2js（毫秒级静态转译，无需下载 13 MB 运行时），支持 Python 常用子集：变量 / 流程控制 / 函数 / 类 / 列表字典 / 推导式 / f-string / import math 等；不支持第三方库、input() 交互与 open() 文件读写。「查看 JS」可看到转译产物。文件夹功能需 Chrome / Edge 桌面版；Firefox / Safari 自动降级为纯编辑缓冲模式（新建脚本 + 运行）。</p>
  </div>

  <div id="compat" class="compat" hidden>
    当前浏览器不支持「本地文件夹」能力（需要 Chrome / Edge 桌面版的 File System Access API）。仍可使用纯编辑缓冲模式：点「＋ 新建」写代码、Ctrl+Enter 运行；保存到磁盘请在 Chrome/Edge 中打开本页。
  </div>

  <div class="ide">
    <aside class="side">
      <div class="side-head">
        <button id="btnOpen" class="btn">📂 打开文件夹</button>
        <button id="btnReconnect" class="btn ghost" hidden>🔌 重连</button>
      </div>
      <div id="tree" class="tree"></div>
      <div class="side-foot">
        <div class="dir" id="dirName">未连接</div>
        <button id="btnWipe" class="btn danger" title="清除本工具的浏览器缓存（不会删除磁盘文件）">🗑 清除本地缓存</button>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="main">
      <div id="tabs" class="tabs"></div>
      <div class="editor">
        <div id="gutter" class="gutter" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
        <div class="hl-wrap">
          <pre class="hl" id="hl" aria-hidden="true"><code></code></pre>
          <textarea
            id="code"
            spellcheck="false"
            autocapitalize="off"
            autocomplete="off"
            placeholder="新建脚本、或从左侧打开 .py 文件开始编辑…（Ctrl+Enter 运行）"
            aria-label="Python 代码"
          ></textarea>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="statusbar">
        <span id="stFile">未打开文件</span>
        <span id="stPos">1:1</span>
        <span id="stState"></span>
        <span class="grow"></span>
        <span id="stPy">py2js 未加载 · 运行时自动加载</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="toolbar">
    <button id="btnRun" class="btn run">▶ 运行 <span class="kbd">Ctrl↵</span></button>
    <button id="btnSave" class="btn">💾 保存 <span class="kbd">Ctrl+S</span></button>
    <button id="btnViewJs" class="btn ghost">查看 JS</button>
    <span class="sep"></span>
    <button id="btnNew" class="btn ghost">＋ 新建</button>
    <button id="btnDemo" class="btn ghost">示例</button>
    <button id="btnClear" class="btn ghost">清空输出</button>
    <span id="elapsed" class="elapsed"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="output">
    <div id="out"><div class="out-empty">输出显示在这里。新建脚本或从左侧打开 .py，按 Ctrl+Enter 运行。</div></div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .intro p { margin: 0.3em 0; font-size: 0.94rem; }
  .intro .muted { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.86rem; }
  .intro kbd {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
  }

  .compat {
    background: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.4);
    color: #b45309;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    margin-top: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ---- IDE 三栏骨架 ---- */
  .ide {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0, 1fr);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    margin-top: 14px;
    min-height: 540px;
  }
  .side {
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--card);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .side-head {
    padding: 10px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .side-head .btn { flex: 1; font-size: 0.82rem; padding: 7px 8px; }
  .tree { flex: 1; overflow: auto; padding: 6px 4px 10px; }
  .tree-hint {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    padding: 14px 12px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .tree-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .tree-row:hover { background: var(--bg-soft); }
  .tree-row .tw { flex: none; width: 14px; color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.7rem; }
  .tree-row .ic { flex: none; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .tree-row .nm { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .tree-empty { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 2px 8px 2px 34px; }
  .side-foot { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 10px; }
  .side-foot .dir {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .btn.danger {
    color: #dc2626;
    border-color: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.4);
    width: 100%;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    padding: 6px 8px;
  }
  .btn.danger:hover { border-color: #dc2626; background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.06); }

  .main { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; }
  .tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 8px 8px 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    min-height: 42px;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }
  .tab-empty { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 8px 4px; }
  .tab {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: none;
    border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .tab.on { background: var(--bg-soft); color: var(--fg); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .tab-x { opacity: 0.55; padding: 0 2px; }
  .tab-x:hover { opacity: 1; color: #dc2626; }

  .editor { flex: 1; display: flex; min-height: 340px; }
  .gutter {
    flex: none;
    width: 48px;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 14px 10px 14px 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: right;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    opacity: 0.55;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    user-select: none;
    white-space: pre;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .hl-wrap { position: relative; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .hl-wrap pre.hl {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    tab-size: 4;
    color: var(--fg);
    pointer-events: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }
  pre.hl code { font: inherit; }
  .editor textarea {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    resize: none;
    border: none;
    outline: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: transparent;
    caret-color: var(--fg);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    tab-size: 4;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }
  .editor textarea::placeholder { color: var(--fg-muted); opacity: 0.7; }
  .tok-kw { color: #8b5cf6; font-weight: 600; }
  .tok-str { color: #b45309; }
  .tok-com { color: var(--fg-muted); font-style: italic; }
  .tok-num { color: #0284c7; }
  .tok-bi { color: #0d9488; }
  .tok-cl { color: #db2777; }

  .statusbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .statusbar .grow { flex: 1; }
  #stState.dirty { color: #d97706; }
  #stPy.ready { color: #16a34a; }
  #stPy.error { color: #dc2626; }

  /* ---- 工具栏与输出 ---- */
  .toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 12px 0; }
  .btn {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .btn.run { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
  .btn.run:hover { color: #fff; filter: brightness(1.08); }
  .btn.ghost { background: var(--bg-soft); }
  .kbd {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    opacity: 0.75;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0 4px;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .sep { width: 1px; height: 20px; background: var(--border); margin: 0 4px; }
  .elapsed { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.82rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin-left: auto; }

  .output {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    min-height: 120px;
    max-height: 480px;
    overflow: auto;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .out-empty { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .out-line {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-all;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .out-line.err { color: #dc2626; }
  .out-line.ok { color: var(--fg); }
  .out-line.sys { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .js-view {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    overflow: auto;
    max-height: 380px;
    white-space: pre;
    margin: 6px 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .ide { grid-template-columns: 1fr; min-height: 0; }
    .side { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); max-height: 300px; }
    .tree { max-height: 170px; }
    .editor { min-height: 300px; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  // py-ide 入口：状态管理 + DOM 渲染粘合层（文件系统 / 存储 / 高亮见 src/scripts/py-ide/）
  import { hlPython } from '../../scripts/py-ide/highlight.js';
  import {
    lsGet, lsSet, lsDel, lsWipe, lsKeys, bufKey, BUF_LS_PREFIX, idbWipe,
  } from '../../scripts/py-ide/storage.js';
  import {
    hasFSA, pickDirectory, ensurePerm, buildTree, readTextFile, saveTextFile,
    mkpath, rememberDir, recallDir, forgetDir, PY_EXT, TEXT_EXT,
  } from '../../scripts/py-ide/vfs.js';

  const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
  const codeEl = $('code');
  const hlEl = $('hl');
  const hlCode = hlEl.querySelector('code');
  const gutter = $('gutter');
  const tabsEl = $('tabs');
  const treeEl = $('tree');
  const outEl = $('out');
  const elapsedEl = $('elapsed');
  const stFile = $('stFile');
  const stPos = $('stPos');
  const stState = $('stState');
  const stPy = $('stPy');
  const dirNameEl = $('dirName');
  const compatEl = $('compat');
  const btnOpen = $('btnOpen');
  const btnReconnect = $('btnReconnect');
  const btnWipe = $('btnWipe');
  const btnRun = $('btnRun');
  const btnSave = $('btnSave');
  const btnViewJs = $('btnViewJs');
  const btnNew = $('btnNew');
  const btnDemo = $('btnDemo');
  const btnClear = $('btnClear');

  // ---- 状态 ----
  let dirRoot = null; // FileSystemDirectoryHandle（工作目录）
  let treeRoot = null; // buildTree 结果
  const expanded = new Set(['']);
  let bufs = []; // { path, text, dirty, fileHandle, dirHandle }
  let active = -1;
  let pyState = 'idle'; // idle | loading | ready | error
  let untitledSeq = 1;

  const msg = (e) => (e && e.message ? e.message : String(e));

  // ---- 输出面板 ----
  function clearEmpty() {
    const empty = outEl.querySelector('.out-empty');
    if (empty) empty.remove();
  }
  function addLine(text, cls) {
    clearEmpty();
    const p = document.createElement('div');
    p.className = 'out-line ' + (cls || 'ok');
    p.textContent = text;
    outEl.appendChild(p);
    outEl.scrollTop = outEl.scrollHeight;
  }
  const sysLine = (t) => addLine(t, 'sys');
  function addPre(text) {
    clearEmpty();
    const pre = document.createElement('pre');
    pre.className = 'js-view';
    pre.textContent = text;
    outEl.appendChild(pre);
    outEl.scrollTop = outEl.scrollHeight;
  }

  // ---- py2js 引擎 ----
  function setPyStatus() {
    stPy.className = pyState;
    stPy.textContent =
      pyState === 'ready' ? 'py2js 就绪'
      : pyState === 'loading' ? 'py2js 加载中…'
      : pyState === 'error' ? 'py2js 加载失败'
      : 'py2js 未加载 · 运行时自动加载';
  }
  function ensurePy(then) {
    if (window.PY2JS) {
      if (pyState !== 'ready') {
        pyState = 'ready';
        setPyStatus();
      }
      then();
      return;
    }
    if (pyState === 'error') {
      sysLine('py2js 转译器此前加载失败，请刷新页面重试');
      return;
    }
    pyState = 'loading';
    setPyStatus();
    const s = document.createElement('script');
    const base = String((import.meta.env.BASE_URL || '/')).replace(/\/?$/, '/');
    s.src = new URL(base + 'assets/py2js.bundle.js', document.baseURI).href;
    s.onload = () => {
      if (window.PY2JS) {
        pyState = 'ready';
        setPyStatus();
        then();
      } else {
        pyState = 'error';
        setPyStatus();
        addLine('py2js 加载异常：PY2JS 全局不可用', 'err');
      }
    };
    s.onerror = () => {
      pyState = 'error';
      setPyStatus();
      addLine('py2js 转译器脚本加载失败（' + base + 'assets/py2js.bundle.js）', 'err');
    };
    document.head.appendChild(s);
  }

  function doRun(src) {
    const P = window.PY2JS;
    const t0 = performance.now();
    let r = null;
    try {
      r = P.runPython(src);
    } catch (e) {
      addLine('运行异常: ' + msg(e), 'err');
      return;
    }
    const tMs = performance.now() - t0;
    if (r && r.errors && r.errors.length) {
      r.errors.forEach((e) => addLine((e.line ? '第 ' + e.line + ' 行: ' : '') + (e.message != null ? e.message : e.msg), 'err'));
      elapsedEl.textContent = '失败 · ' + tMs.toFixed(1) + ' ms';
      return;
    }
    const out = (r && r.out) || '';
    if (out.length) out.split('\n').forEach((l) => addLine(l, 'ok'));
    else addLine('(无输出)', 'sys');
    elapsedEl.textContent = '转译+运行 ' + tMs.toFixed(1) + ' ms';
  }

  function runActive() {
    const b = bufs[active];
    if (!b) {
      sysLine('先新建或打开一个 .py 文件');
      return;
    }
    if (!PY_EXT.test(b.path)) {
      sysLine('仅 .py 文件可运行（当前：' + b.path + '）；该文件仍可编辑与保存');
      return;
    }
    const src = codeEl.value;
    ensurePy(() => doRun(src));
  }

  function viewJs() {
    const b = bufs[active];
    if (!b) {
      sysLine('先新建或打开一个脚本');
      return;
    }
    ensurePy(() => {
      const r = window.PY2JS.transpile(b.text);
      if (r.errors && r.errors.length) {
        r.errors.forEach((e) => addLine('行 ' + e.line + ': ' + (e.msg != null ? e.msg : e.message), 'err'));
        return;
      }
      addPre(r.body || '(空)');
      elapsedEl.textContent = '转译产物 ' + ((r.body || '').length / 1024).toFixed(1) + ' KB';
    });
  }

  // ---- 编辑器同步 ----
  function syncHl() {
    hlCode.innerHTML = hlPython(codeEl.value) + '\n';
  }
  function syncGutter() {
    const n = codeEl.value.split('\n').length;
    let h = '';
    for (let i = 1; i <= n; i++) h += i + '\n';
    gutter.textContent = h;
  }
  function updatePos() {
    const s = codeEl.selectionStart || 0;
    const rows = codeEl.value.slice(0, s).split('\n');
    stPos.textContent = rows.length + ':' + (rows[rows.length - 1].length + 1);
  }
  function updateStatus() {
    const b = bufs[active];
    stFile.textContent = b ? b.path : '未打开文件';
    if (b && b.dirty) {
      stState.textContent = '● 未保存';
      stState.className = 'dirty';
    } else {
      stState.textContent = b ? '已保存' : '';
      stState.className = '';
    }
  }
  function refreshEditorUI() {
    syncHl();
    syncGutter();
    updatePos();
    updateStatus();
  }

  // ---- 标签页 ----
  function renderTabs() {
    tabsEl.innerHTML = '';
    if (!bufs.length) {
      const sp = document.createElement('span');
      sp.className = 'tab-empty';
      sp.textContent = '未打开文件 —— 「＋ 新建」或从左侧打开 .py';
      tabsEl.appendChild(sp);
      return;
    }
    bufs.forEach((b, i) => {
      const t = document.createElement('div');
      t.className = 'tab' + (i === active ? ' on' : '');
      t.title = b.path + (b.dirty ? '（未保存）' : '');
      const nm = document.createElement('span');
      nm.textContent = (b.dirty ? '● ' : '') + b.path.split('/').pop();
      t.appendChild(nm);
      const x = document.createElement('span');
      x.className = 'tab-x';
      x.textContent = '✕';
      x.title = '关闭标签';
      x.addEventListener('click', (ev) => {
        ev.stopPropagation();
        closeTab(i);
      });
      t.appendChild(x);
      t.addEventListener('click', () => activate(i));
      tabsEl.appendChild(t);
    });
  }
  function activate(i) {
    active = i;
    const b = bufs[i];
    codeEl.value = b.text;
    renderTabs();
    refreshEditorUI();
    codeEl.focus();
  }
  function closeTab(i) {
    const b = bufs[i];
    if (b.dirty && !window.confirm('「' + b.path + '」有未保存修改。\n关闭标签将丢弃这些修改（本地暂存也会清除），确定？')) return;
    lsDel(bufKey(b.path));
    bufs.splice(i, 1);
    if (!bufs.length) active = -1;
    else active = Math.min(active, bufs.length - 1);
    codeEl.value = active >= 0 ? bufs[active].text : '';
    renderTabs();
    refreshEditorUI();
  }
  function pushBuf(b) {
    bufs.push(b);
    activate(bufs.length - 1);
  }

  // ---- 文件树 ----
  function iconFor(name) {
    if (/\.py$/i.test(name)) return '🐍';
    if (/\.(md|txt|log)$/i.test(name)) return '📝';
    if (/\.json$/i.test(name)) return '🗂️';
    if (/\.(js|mjs|cjs|ts)$/i.test(name)) return '📜';
    if (/\.(html|css|astro)$/i.test(name)) return '🌐';
    if (/\.(csv|tsv|yaml|yml|toml|ini|cfg|conf)$/i.test(name)) return '📊';
    return '📄';
  }
  function renderTree() {
    treeEl.innerHTML = '';
    if (!treeRoot) {
      const hint = document.createElement('div');
      hint.className = 'tree-hint';
      hint.innerHTML = '尚未打开文件夹。<br>点上方「📂 打开文件夹」选择本地目录作为工作区——<b>文件不经过任何服务器</b>。';
      treeEl.appendChild(hint);
      return;
    }
    const frag = document.createDocumentFragment();
    const emit = (node, depth) => {
      const row = document.createElement('div');
      row.className = 'tree-row';
      row.style.paddingLeft = 6 + depth * 14 + 'px';
      const tw = document.createElement('span');
      tw.className = 'tw';
      const ic = document.createElement('span');
      ic.className = 'ic';
      const nm = document.createElement('span');
      nm.className = 'nm';
      nm.textContent = node.name;
      if (node.kind === 'dir') {
        const open = expanded.has(node.path);
        tw.textContent = open ? '▾' : '▸';
        ic.textContent = open ? '📂' : '📁';
        row.append(tw, ic, nm);
        row.title = node.path;
        row.addEventListener('click', () => {
          if (expanded.has(node.path)) expanded.delete(node.path);
          else expanded.add(node.path);
          renderTree();
        });
        frag.appendChild(row);
        if (open) {
          if (node.children && node.children.length) node.children.forEach((c) => emit(c, depth + 1));
          else {
            const e = document.createElement('div');
            e.className = 'tree-empty';
            e.textContent = '（空目录）';
            frag.appendChild(e);
          }
        }
      } else {
        tw.textContent = ' ';
        ic.textContent = iconFor(node.name);
        row.append(tw, ic, nm);
        row.title = node.path + ' —— 点击打开';
        row.addEventListener('click', () => openNode(node));
        frag.appendChild(row);
      }
    };
    if (treeRoot.children.length) treeRoot.children.forEach((c) => emit(c, 0));
    else {
      const e = document.createElement('div');
      e.className = 'tree-empty';
      e.textContent = '（空目录）';
      frag.appendChild(e);
    }
    treeEl.appendChild(frag);
  }
  async function refreshTree() {
    if (!dirRoot) return;
    treeRoot = await buildTree(dirRoot);
    renderTree();
  }

  // ---- 打开 / 保存 ----
  async function openNode(node) {
    if (!TEXT_EXT.test(node.name)) {
      sysLine('暂不支持编辑该类型：' + node.name + '（支持文本类文件：py / txt / md / json / js / html / css …）');
      return;
    }
    const idx = bufs.findIndex((b) => b.path === node.path);
    if (idx >= 0) {
      activate(idx);
      return;
    }
    const r = await readTextFile(node.handle);
    if (!r.ok) {
      sysLine(r.err);
      return;
    }
    let text = r.text;
    let dirty = false;
    const saved = lsGet(bufKey(node.path));
    if (saved != null && saved !== r.text) {
      text = saved;
      dirty = true;
      sysLine('已恢复「' + node.path + '」未保存的修改（暂存内容优先显示，Ctrl+S 覆盖磁盘）');
    }
    const loc = dirRoot ? await mkpath(dirRoot, node.path, false) : null;
    pushBuf({
      path: node.path,
      text,
      dirty,
      fileHandle: node.handle,
      dirHandle: loc ? loc.dir : null,
    });
  }

  async function saveActive() {
    const b = bufs[active];
    if (!b) {
      sysLine('没有可保存的标签页');
      return;
    }
    if (!dirRoot) {
      sysLine('尚未连接工作目录：点左侧「📂 打开文件夹」后再保存；或直接运行（运行不要求保存）');
      return;
    }
    try {
      if (!b.fileHandle) {
        const rel = window.prompt('保存为（相对工作目录的路径，可用子目录，如 src/main.py）：', b.path);
        if (rel == null) return;
        const loc = await mkpath(dirRoot, rel, true);
        if (!loc) {
          sysLine('路径无效或创建失败：' + rel);
          return;
        }
        b.fileHandle = await loc.dir.getFileHandle(loc.name, { create: true });
        b.dirHandle = loc.dir;
        b.path = loc.rel;
      }
      const ok = await ensurePerm(b.dirHandle || dirRoot);
      if (!ok) {
        sysLine('未获得目录写权限，保存取消');
        return;
      }
      const r = await saveTextFile(b.fileHandle, b.text);
      if (!r.ok) {
        sysLine(r.err);
        return;
      }
      b.dirty = false;
      lsDel(bufKey(b.path));
      renderTabs();
      updateStatus();
      sysLine('已保存：' + b.path + '（写入本地磁盘）');
      refreshTree();
    } catch (e) {
      sysLine('保存失败：' + msg(e));
    }
  }

  function newBuf() {
    let name;
    do {
      name = 'untitled-' + untitledSeq++ + '.py';
    } while (bufs.some((b) => b.path === name));
    pushBuf({ path: name, text: '', dirty: true, fileHandle: null, dirHandle: null });
  }

  const DEMO_SRC = `import math

# py2js：毫秒级转译执行 Python 子集（Ctrl+Enter 运行）
def is_prime(n):
    if n < 2:
        return False
    for i in range(2, int(math.sqrt(n)) + 1):
        if n % i == 0:
            return False
    return True

primes = [p for p in range(2, 50) if is_prime(p)]
print("50 以内的素数：", primes)

class Point:
    def __init__(self, x, y):
        self.x = x
        self.y = y
    def dist(self):
        return math.sqrt(self.x ** 2 + self.y ** 2)

pts = [Point(3, 4), Point(6, 8)]
print("到原点距离：", [round(p.dist(), 2) for p in pts])
print(f"共 {len(pts)} 个点, pi ≈ {math.pi:.4f}")
`;
  function loadDemo() {
    const idx = bufs.findIndex((b) => b.path === 'demo.py');
    if (idx >= 0) {
      activate(idx);
      return;
    }
    pushBuf({ path: 'demo.py', text: DEMO_SRC, dirty: true, fileHandle: null, dirHandle: null });
    sysLine('示例已打开，Ctrl+Enter 运行；「查看 JS」可看转译产物');
  }

  // ---- 目录连接 ----
  async function connectDir(h, name, silent) {
    dirRoot = h;
    dirNameEl.textContent = name;
    dirNameEl.title = name;
    btnReconnect.hidden = true;
    await rememberDir(h, name);
    await refreshTree();
    if (!silent) sysLine('已连接工作目录：' + name + '（文件只在你本地读写，不上传）');
  }
  async function onOpen() {
    if (!hasFSA) {
      compatEl.hidden = false;
      return;
    }
    const h = await pickDirectory();
    if (!h) return;
    await connectDir(h, h.name || '已选目录');
  }
  function restoreBufs() {
    const keys = lsKeys().filter((k) => k.indexOf(BUF_LS_PREFIX) === 0);
    keys.sort();
    for (const full of keys) {
      const path = full.slice(BUF_LS_PREFIX.length);
      const text = lsGet('buf:' + path);
      if (text != null) bufs.push({ path, text, dirty: true, fileHandle: null, dirHandle: null });
    }
    if (bufs.length) {
      activate(0);
      sysLine('已恢复 ' + bufs.length + ' 个未保存的标签页（来自本地暂存）');
    }
  }
  async function tryRestore() {
    restoreBufs();
    if (!hasFSA) {
      compatEl.hidden = false;
      btnOpen.disabled = true;
      btnOpen.title = '当前浏览器不支持';
      return;
    }
    const rec = await recallDir();
    if (!rec) return;
    try {
      const st = await rec.handle.queryPermission({ mode: 'readwrite' });
      if (st === 'granted') {
        await connectDir(rec.handle, rec.name, true);
        sysLine('已自动重连上次工作目录：' + rec.name);
      } else if (st === 'prompt') {
        btnReconnect.hidden = false;
        btnReconnect.textContent = '🔌 重连：' + rec.name;
        btnReconnect.title = '上次的工作目录需要重新授权后连接';
      }
    } catch (e) {
      await forgetDir();
    }
  }

  // ---- 清除本地缓存 ----
  btnWipe.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const n = bufs.filter((b) => b.dirty).length;
    const m =
      '清除本工具在浏览器里的全部本地缓存？\n\n' +
      '· 工作目录连接记忆\n· 未保存内容的本地暂存' +
      (n ? '\n\n注意：当前有 ' + n + ' 个未保存的标签页，其暂存内容将被清空' : '') +
      '\n\n磁盘上的文件不会被改动。';
    if (!window.confirm(m)) return;
    await forgetDir();
    const idbOk = await idbWipe();
    lsWipe();
    dirRoot = null;
    treeRoot = null;
    bufs = [];
    active = -1;
    expanded.clear();
    codeEl.value = '';
    refreshEditorUI();
    renderTabs();
    renderTree();
    dirNameEl.textContent = '未连接';
    btnReconnect.hidden = true;
    sysLine('本地缓存已清除（IndexedDB ' + (idbOk ? '已删除' : '被占用，记录已清') + ' + localStorage）。磁盘文件未受影响。');
  });

  // ---- 编辑器事件 ----
  let stageTimer = null;
  function onEdit() {
    const b = bufs[active];
    if (!b) return;
    b.text = codeEl.value;
    if (!b.dirty) b.dirty = true;
    renderTabs();
    syncHl();
    syncGutter();
    updatePos();
    updateStatus();
    clearTimeout(stageTimer);
    stageTimer = setTimeout(() => lsSet(bufKey(b.path), b.text), 400);
  }
  codeEl.addEventListener('input', onEdit);
  codeEl.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
    hlEl.scrollTop = codeEl.scrollTop;
    hlEl.scrollLeft = codeEl.scrollLeft;
    gutter.scrollTop = codeEl.scrollTop;
  });
  codeEl.addEventListener('keyup', updatePos);
  codeEl.addEventListener('click', updatePos);
  codeEl.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key !== 'Tab') return;
    e.preventDefault();
    const s = codeEl.selectionStart;
    const t = codeEl.selectionEnd;
    if (e.shiftKey) {
      const ls = codeEl.value.lastIndexOf('\n', s - 1) + 1;
      const lead = codeEl.value.slice(ls).match(/^ {1,4}/);
      if (lead) {
        codeEl.setRangeText('', ls, ls + lead[0].length, 'end');
        onEdit();
      }
    } else {
      codeEl.setRangeText('    ', s, t, 'end');
      onEdit();
    }
  });

  window.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    const mod = e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey;
    if (!mod) return;
    if (e.key === 's' || e.key === 'S') {
      e.preventDefault();
      saveActive();
    } else if (e.key === 'Enter') {
      e.preventDefault();
      runActive();
    }
  });

  // ---- 按钮 ----
  btnRun.addEventListener('click', runActive);
  btnSave.addEventListener('click', saveActive);
  btnViewJs.addEventListener('click', viewJs);
  btnNew.addEventListener('click', newBuf);
  btnDemo.addEventListener('click', loadDemo);
  btnOpen.addEventListener('click', onOpen);
  btnReconnect.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const rec = await recallDir();
    if (!rec) return;
    const ok = await ensurePerm(rec.handle);
    if (ok) await connectDir(rec.handle, rec.name);
    else sysLine('未获得授权，无法重连（可在浏览器站点设置里重置权限后再试）');
  });
  btnClear.addEventListener('click', () => {
    outEl.innerHTML = '<div class="out-empty">输出已清空。</div>';
    elapsedEl.textContent = '';
  });

  // ---- 启动 ----
  setPyStatus();
  renderTabs();
  renderTree();
  refreshEditorUI();
  tryRestore();
</script>
